<title>POLAND: Paged trades on kerb at PLN 13.1.</title>
<headline>Paged trades on kerb at PLN 13.1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 31,734 shares of Polish wood firm Paged SA at 13.1 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Paged traded at 12.8 zlotys in a volume of 22,751 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
